---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms of Use — DeveX Tools" description="Terms of Use for DeveX Tools. Learn about the rules, guidelines, and legal terms governing your use of our developer tool review platform.">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 32px; max-width: 740px; margin: 40px auto;">
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px;">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By accessing or using DeveX Tools ("the Site"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must discontinue use of the Site immediately. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time; continued use after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">2. Site Description and Use</h2>
      <p>DeveX Tools provides independent, hands-on reviews of developer tools, including IDEs, CI/CD platforms, Git tools, and other software products. All content — including reviews, comparisons, ratings, and editorial articles — is produced by practicing engineers and reflects their genuine opinions. Content is provided for informational and educational purposes only and should not be construed as professional advice, endorsement, or guarantee of any product's suitability for your specific needs.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All content on the Site — including text, graphics, logos, images, and software — is the property of DeveX Tools or its content creators and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, create derivative works from, or publicly display any content without prior written permission. You are welcome to share links to our pages and quote short excerpts with proper attribution to DeveX Tools.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">4. User Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>As a user of the Site, you agree to: (a) use the Site only for lawful purposes; (b) not engage in any activity that disrupts or interferes with the Site's operation or security; (c) not attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Site or its systems; (d) not use automated tools, bots, or scrapers to extract content without prior written consent; and (e) not impersonate any person or entity or misrepresent your affiliation with any person or entity. You are solely responsible for your use of the Site and any content you submit.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>All content on the Site is provided "as is" without any warranties, express or implied. DeveX Tools makes no representations or guarantees regarding the accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or reliability of any content, including third-party tool information, pricing, or feature descriptions. Tool reviews reflect the opinions of our engineering team at the time of writing and may not reflect subsequent updates or changes to the tools being reviewed. We disclaim all liability for any errors or omissions in the content.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>In no event shall DeveX Tools, its operators, contributors, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising out of or relating to your use of, or inability to use, the Site or any content provided herein. This includes, but is not limited to, damages for loss of profits, data, or business opportunities, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">7. External Links and Editorial Disclosure</h2>
      <p>The Site may contain links to third-party websites, products, or services. DeveX Tools does not endorse or assume responsibility for the content, privacy practices, or terms of any third-party sites. We currently do not participate in affiliate or referral programs — see our full <a href="/disclosure" style="color: var(--accent);">Disclosure</a> page for details. We do not accept sponsored or paid reviews, and our editorial content is 100% independent.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">8. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms of Use shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of California, United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. The Site is controlled and operated from the United States, and we make no representation that the content is appropriate or available for use in other locations.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">9. Dispute Resolution</h2>
      <p>Any dispute arising out of or relating to these Terms of Use or your use of the Site shall first be resolved through informal negotiation. If the dispute cannot be resolved within 30 days of one party notifying the other in writing, the dispute shall be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with the rules of the American Arbitration Association. The arbitration shall take place in San Francisco, California. Each party shall bear its own costs and fees, except that the prevailing party may seek recovery of reasonable attorney fees and costs. You agree that any claim or cause of action must be filed within one year after the claim arose, or it will be permanently barred.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">10. Modifications to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Use at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting to the Site, with an updated "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review these terms periodically. Your continued use of the Site after any changes constitutes acceptance of the modified terms. If you do not agree to the modified terms, you must stop using the Site.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">11. Refund Policy</h2>
      <p>DeveX Tools provides all content free of charge. As the Site does not sell products or services directly, no refund policy applies. In the event that paid services are introduced in the future, a separate refund policy will be published and govern those transactions. Any donations or voluntary payments made to support the Site are non-refundable.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">12. Service Termination</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to suspend, limit, or terminate your access to the Site at any time, with or without notice, for any reason, including but not limited to violation of these Terms of Use, conduct that we believe is harmful to the Site or other users, or as required by law. Upon termination, your right to use the Site immediately ceases. Sections of these terms that by their nature should survive termination (including disclaimers, limitations of liability, and governing law) shall continue to apply.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--text);">13. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>For questions about these Terms of Use, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@devex-tools.net" style="color: var(--accent);">info@devex-tools.net</a>. You may also reach us through our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--accent);">Contact</a> page.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
